{% if facts.kind == "preparation" %}
Subject: [{{ npi_no }}] Material preparation request - {{ facts.po.po_no }} Rev {{ facts.po.rev }}
{% else %}
Subject: [{{ npi_no }}] Material change notice - {{ facts.ecr_no or facts.rev }} / {{ facts.po.po_no }} Rev {{ facts.po.rev }}
{% endif %}
Hi {{ to.name.split()[0] }},

{% if facts.kind == "preparation" %}
PO {{ facts.po.po_no }} Rev {{ facts.po.rev }} received for {{ "{:,}".format(facts.po.total_qty) }} x {{ facts.lpc_pn }}. Please prepare material per the released BOM ({{ facts.rev }}) and confirm ETAs.
{% else %}
{{ facts.ecr_no or "ECR" }}: BOM released as {{ facts.rev }} for {{ facts.lpc_pn }}. Quantities based on PO {{ facts.po.po_no }} Rev {{ facts.po.rev }} ({{ "{:,}".format(facts.po.total_qty) }} pcs){% if facts.po_from_rev != facts.rev %}, carried over from {{ facts.po_from_rev }} (no new PO for {{ facts.rev }}){% endif %}.

Added:
{% for p in facts.changes.added %}
- {{ p }}
{% else %}
- none
{% endfor %}
Removed:
{% for p in facts.changes.removed %}
- {{ p }}
{% else %}
- none
{% endfor %}
Changed qty per FAU:
{% for c in facts.changes.changed %}
- {{ c.part_no }}: {{ c["from"] }} -> {{ c.to }}
{% else %}
- none
{% endfor %}
{% if facts.changes.get("pending_pn") %}
Part number pending (not compared):
{% for d in facts.changes.get("pending_pn") %}
- {{ d }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

Gross requirement (qty per FAU x {{ "{:,}".format(facts.po.total_qty) }} pcs), without scrap allowance; stock not deducted:
{% for r in facts.requirements %}
- {{ "%-18s"|format(r.part_no) }} {{ r.qty_per if r.qty_per is not none else "待工程師填寫" }} {{ r.uom }}/FAU -> {{ "{:,}".format(r.gross_qty) if r.gross_qty is not none else "待工程師填寫" }} {{ r.uom }}; lead time {{ r.lead_time_days if r.lead_time_days is not none else "待工程師填寫" }} days{% if not r.in_mm002 %} (NOT IN LPC-MM-002){% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% for n in j.get('notes', []) %}
{{ n.text }}
{% endfor %}

Thanks,
{{ sender.name }}
{{ sender.title }}
